# SKOS mappings: fao-dvi -> ATIO, 2026-10-07
# Load into the named graph https://sti-portal.fao.org/graph/mappings,
# not into rdf_sync's graph: rdf_sync rewrites a term's triples on save.
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix atio: <https://sti-portal.fao.org/atio#> .
@prefix prop: <https://sti-portal.fao.org/id/property/> .

# Labels
prop:ec9f8d5b-3482-42f1-8cee-79185b9739f3 rdfs:label "Primary users" .
